{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here is the translation of the updated text:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is a casual puzzle game that combines mathematical calculations and basic elimination gameplay. In the game, you can slide the mouse to determine the movement direction of all &quot;blocks,&quot; and through repeated decisions, gradually strengthen the &quot;Blue Legion&quot; to ultimately defeat the evil &quot;Red Legion.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay Instructions:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slide the mouse to control the movement of all blocks.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/\u63a7\u5236\u5757.gif?t=1742901706\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blocks of the same color and value can merge to strengthen the legion\u2019s power!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/\u5408\u5e76.gif?t=1742901706\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If a block's value is greater than or equal to the enemy\u2019s, it can &quot;eat&quot; the enemy and generate a new block.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/\u5403\uff01.gif?t=1742901706\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control your Blue Legion and achieve victory!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429970/extras/\u80dc\u5229\uff01.gif?t=1742901706\" /></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Apprentice Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3429970/7fd45c6c47e6bbe3e00817ea393a723076f08d15.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Navigator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3429970/dc6a4b98311140e3ed1548d670393938ff240e2b.jpg"},{"name":"Journeyman Explor